@url = http://localhost:7070/api

### Hello world – virker serveren?
GET {{url}}/hello

### Oversigt over alle endpoints og roller
GET {{url}}/routes


### ===== AUTH =====

### Opret bruger → 201 + token (gemmes som userToken)
POST {{url}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "elias",
  "password": "hemmelig123"
}

> {% client.global.set("userToken", response.body.token); %}

### Login som bruger → 200 + token (gemmes som userToken)
POST {{url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "elias",
  "password": "hemmelig123"
}

> {% client.global.set("userToken", response.body.token); %}

### Login som admin (ADMIN_USERNAME / ADMIN_PASSWORD fra config.properties) → gemmes som adminToken
POST {{url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "3ofKopTUjxePVbGi"
}

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.token); %}

### Forkert password → 401
POST {{url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "elias",
  "password": "forkert123"
}

### Opret samme bruger igen → 409
POST {{url}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "elias",
  "password": "hemmelig123"
}

### Ugyldigt brugernavn og for kort password → 400
POST {{url}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "e!",
  "password": "kort"
}

### Hvem er jeg? (USER) → 200
GET {{url}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Hvem er jeg? uden token → 401
GET {{url}}/auth/me

### Ødelagt token → 401
GET {{url}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer abc.def.ghi


### ===== MENU (åben) =====

### Dagens ret
GET {{url}}/menu/today

### Ugens menu (mandag–fredag)
GET {{url}}/menu/week


### ===== EVENTS =====

### Events de næste 14 dage (åben)
GET {{url}}/events

### Events de næste 30 dage (åben)
GET {{url}}/events?days=30

### Ugyldigt antal dage → 400
GET {{url}}/events?days=0

### Opret event som admin → 201 (createdBy kommer fra tokenet)
POST {{url}}/events
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "title": "Fredagsbar",
  "description": "Øl og musik i kantinen",
  "location": "Kantinen",
  "startTime": "2026-10-30T16:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-10-30T22:00:00"
}

> {% client.global.set("eventId", response.body.id); %}

### Opret event uden token → 401
POST {{url}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Fredagsbar",
  "startTime": "2026-10-30T16:00:00"
}

### Opret event som almindelig bruger → 403
POST {{url}}/events
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

{
  "title": "Fredagsbar",
  "startTime": "2026-10-30T16:00:00"
}

### Opret event uden titel og med slut før start → 400
POST {{url}}/events
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "title": "",
  "startTime": "2026-10-30T16:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-10-30T12:00:00"
}

### Hent det oprettede event (åben)
GET {{url}}/events/{{eventId}}

### Ret sted på eventet (admin)
PATCH {{url}}/events/{{eventId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "location": "Aulaen"
}

### Slet eventet (admin) → 204
DELETE {{url}}/events/{{eventId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Event der ikke findes → 404
GET {{url}}/events/999999

### Id der ikke er et tal → 400
GET {{url}}/events/abc
